{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上10時半，屯門美樂站對開有空載輕鐵與5.5噸貨車相撞，初步無人受傷。</p><p>網上圖片可見，一輛密斗貨車與輕鐵停在路中。</p><p>港鐵宣布，受交通意外影響，美樂站附近輕鐵服務暫停。</p><figure><img alt=\"港鐵發放消息，輕鐵服務受阻。（手機截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202575020237262848837190.png/YW6sgQt3nHnJH3dXdVAb_kDvDnChfp3OVQspAVULKQE\"/><figcaption>港鐵發放消息，輕鐵服務受阻。（手機截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:59:24.122646+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:48:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:52:47.771208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:52:47.771208+00:00","content_hash":"fe8a06ef70102edaa6d30e0dcfa520b9c526cf00dd7dc54adab05702f510de47","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}